  "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
  "text": "You control the seed boat while Pip waits on the bank. Launch it, then click water, use the arrow keys or choose a direction. Go around the rock. The blue landing is where Grandma can receive the seed. To cancel, return to the yellow launch and unload. Help and Pause stop the boat where it is.\n\nReturn to Sol’s discussion. You can ask him to tell the listeners about the bread or thank-you visit, or keep his draft as it is.\n\nYour first moments will appear here as you take part in the adventure. You can write a thought now or return whenever you like.\n\nHere is your complete ending. Loop is paused while you read. Return to the show and choose Resume story when you are ready.\n\nThe invited guests are here. Return to the gathering, read Pip’s welcome if you like, then welcome everyone in the garden.\n\nAutomatic transcription is unavailable. You can practise saying your answer, then return and type it in your own words.\n\nPip crossed the repaired footbridge after both ends were secured. The bridge stayed in place for the return journey.\n\nSteer around the rock to the blue landing. Give Grandma the seed there, or return to the yellow launch and unload.\n\nThe telling is paused. Read the complete text at your own pace. When you return to the game, choose Resume story.\n\nThese are the words and choices you just saw. Reading them leaves your choices open. Return to the game to act.\n\nThe seed is still aboard. Dock at Grandma’s landing, or return to the launch and unload before guiding Pip.\n\nGrandma understands both friends now. Return to the gathering to let her bring out the stored cushions.\n\nThese passengers are safely ashore. Mara stays on duty: the last boat still has to return later.\n\nReturn to the game and walk with Rina. The loaf stays in her hands until she gives it to Sol.",
  "textSha256": "15ef73137b7694f8287cc7ddb4e46d42d2ea24b2bded2e1e01a8104881c912f2",
